      "startMs": 5000,
      "endMs": 13000
    },
    {
      "chunkId": "semantic-example-ux-onboarding_03",
      "text": "所以引导页应该先让他完成一次录音，而不是先解释所有配置。",
      "startMs": 13000,
      "endMs": 21000
    }
